UID:10026490-1780833600-1780844400@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Bluegrass Brunch Is Back!!
DESCRIPTION:Y’ALL! The best dang BLUEGRASS BRUNCH in town is BACK AT JACK — with our own BLUEGRASS BRUNCH BOYS taking the stage at NOON! 🎻🍳 \nWhether you’re in the mood for a FRIED CHICKEN BISCUIT topped with our house-made blackberry jam or spicy SHRIMP & CHEDDAR GRITS with a side of collards or that perfect BURGER (beef OR veggie) with hand-cut pub fries\, you’ll find exactly what you’re craving at — and did we mention our brunch beverage specials from the bar? 🥂🍊 \nBrunch is served until 3pm (or until we run out!)\, with our pub fare menu starting immediately after. \nAnd to round out your SUNDAY FUNDAY\, our TRADITIONAL IRISH MUSIC SESSION starts at 3:30 — and goes until close! 🍺🍀\n \n\nJack Of The Wood still a downtown hot spot for food\, brews and drink since 1997 and founders Joan and Joe Eckert who still own it\, have maintained the original lively English and Irish vibe. The old-time mountain and Irish music jams continue\, including a hot bluegrass jam Thursdays and brunch every Sunday. The venue extends a welcoming feeling to regulars and newcomers to this day. https://jackofthewood.com/
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/the-bluegrass-boys-2/2026-06-07/
LOCATION:Jack Of The Wood\, 95 Patton Ave\, asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/521057437_1508890810466928_6057889169935657981_n-e1754136196712.jpg
GEO:35.5944492;-82.5558221
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Jack Of The Wood 95 Patton Ave asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=95 Patton Ave:geo:-82.5558221,35.5944492
END:VEVENT
